@startuml swap-execution
!include _theme.iuml
skinparam linetype polyline
title Swap (Soroban)
caption Quote to aggregator.swap. One InvokeHostFunction. Output returns to the user. Numbers match the Architecture page.

actor User
participant Wallet
participant "api-server" as API
participant "Soroban RPC" as RPC
participant Aggregator
participant "DEX pools" as Pools

User -> API : 1. GET /api/v1/quote
API --> User : 2. expected_output · sub_routes
User -> API : 3. POST /api/v1/build_tx
API -> RPC : 4. simulate aggregator.swap
RPC --> API : footprint · auth · min resource fee
API --> User : unsigned XDR
User -> Wallet : 5. sign
Wallet --> User : signed XDR
User -> API : 6. POST /api/v1/submit_tx\n(or any same-network RPC)
API -> RPC : sendTransaction
RPC -> Aggregator : swap(user, token_in, token_out,\nsub_routes, min_amount_out)
Aggregator -> Aggregator : 7. pull token_in from user
Aggregator -> Pools : 7. execute each hop (CPI)
Pools --> Aggregator : hop outputs
Aggregator -> Aggregator : 7. require total_out >= min_amount_out
Aggregator --> User : 7. transfer token_out

@enduml
